available under these terms, including any part, copy or change of it. You
means the person or organisation that operates, deploys or directs anything
that obtains or uses the software by any means, including an AI agent; what
your agents do with the software, you do. Your company means any organisation
you work for and any organisation that controls, is controlled by or is under
common control with it. A contribution is anything you submit to the licensor
for possible inclusion in the software. The repository, contribution channel,
security channel, service terms, governing law and courts are those named in
the NOTICE file.

1. Acceptance. To receive any licence you must accept these terms as both
strict obligations and conditions of every licence. Doing anything with the
software that needs a licence, or causing an agent to do so, is acceptance,
and you agree to deal electronically. Without acceptance you have no licence.
These terms do not limit fair use or any other right the law gives you without
a licence.

