non-transferable and non-sublicensable licence to copy, search, analyse, quote
and change the software, and to run it on systems you control, including by
placing it in an AI model's context while the model performs a task, but only
to understand, discuss or improve the software or to use the licensor's
services. You may also train machine-learning models on the software, but any
output that reproduces the software remains subject to these terms.

3. Contribute. Submit contributions only through the contribution channel; the
licensor may ignore any other. For each contribution you (a) assign to the
