and forking on GitHub, come from those terms, not from these.

5. Report, don't exploit. If you or your agents find a flaw in the software,
or in any service the licensor runs with it, that could let anyone reach data
or accounts they should not, disrupt a service, or obtain a result the service
terms do not intend, you must report it promptly and privately through the
